#: price-history/admin/settings.php:98
msgid "Record every WooCommerce price change and show the EU Omnibus lowest price from the last 30 days, a price history chart, and the base price and digital price list required in Croatia. This module is a display helper and does not provide legal advice or guarantee compliance."
msgstr ""
"Rögzítsen minden WooCommerce árváltozást, és jelenítse meg az uniós Omnibus-"
